<description>&lt;p&gt;The United States struck Iran's Qeshm Island and disabled a commercial vessel attempting to run a blockade in the Gulf of Oman, while Iran launched a missile that hit a building in Tel Aviv. Iran opened a training camp for women in readiness for war and classified the Argentine navy and air force as terrorist organizations in a reciprocal move. Republicans blocked an effort to impeach Defence Secretary Pete Hegseth over the Iran war, and a separate impeachment motion was blocked with several Democrats absent. The conflict has caused 123 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/live/2026/nov/11/donald-trump-pete-hegseth-impeachment-democrats-republicans-arlington-latest-news-updates&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ft.com/content/c844b957-3c98-43a3-b02e-2d0f5368bd49?syn-25a6b1a6=1&quot;&gt;Financial Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/video/2026/11/09/turkey-delegates-arrive-in-antalya-as-cop31-climate-talks-begin&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/09/world/europe/france-iran-refrigerators-cyberattack.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/11/trump-planning-military-assault-or-tighter-sanctions-iranian-officials&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/10/us/politics/rubio-iran-war.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/10/qatar-sees-progress-in-us-iran-talks-after-white-house-meeting&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxQek5TR25SaDZ3eDVOVkUwdWZhUURfZTJ0NzFDTXpyc3RISkJXNXlKMkRSZ05uWUdRRFlELXJLcFRJZFppSFBxcVpfV2RkOGNOQ3NxQnVGLUx1dHlqRGd